===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|penny}}, {{m|enm|peny}}, from {{inh|en|ang|peniġ}}, {{m|ang|penniġ}}, {{m|ang|penning|t=penny}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*panning}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*panningaz}}, of uncertain origin (see that page for theories). {{doublet|en|pfennig|fening}}.

